       275    1CALCULATOR KOMPV                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
       276    1    DEFINE P BLOCK-VAR BLOCK=LK2 VARIABLE=PRES SENTENCE=PARAM  &                                                                                                                                                                                                
       277    1        UOM="BAR"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
       278    1    DEFINE PIN STREAM-VAR STREAM=S1 SUBSTREAM=MIXED  &                                                                                                                                                                                                          
